  m_text: "Hello there \r\nI\u2019m here with you during the recovery journey. You
    can command me to stay or follow by clicking the button below. If you feed me
    some yummy treats, I\u2019ll grow bigger!\n\r\nIf you want to further train your
    fingers, put your controllers aside, press the Magic Room button on your left
    palm, and explore more fun training options.\n\r\nTips: \r\n\u2022 Each task
    offers a tutorial video, which will activate when you approach them\r\n\u2022
    Try to reach the goal on the Training Data Panel, which can be moved\r\n\u2022
    Using teleportation to avoid dizziness\r\n\u2022 Adjust the background music
    volume with the slider below\r\n\u2022 Tap the icon to open or close the menu"
